// canada-residency — keep data in Canada
//
// The law: some Canadian rules do require data to stay in Canada, notably
// Nova Scotia's Personal Information International Disclosure Protection
// Act for public bodies and their service providers, and many federal and
// provincial government contracts.
//
// This pack: everything runs in Canada.
//
// Use `import "canada-residency"`, often together with "pipeda".
// Not legal advice.

policy canada-residency {
  residency = ca
}
